1
00:00:09,730 --> 00:00:14,880
This painting is one of the most controversial and shocking images in Russian art.

2
00:00:15,699 --> 00:00:22,660
When it was unveiled in 1885, it caused such a scandal that the Tsar himself banned it from public view.

3
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:31,859
Since then, it has been physically attacked twice, slashed in 1913 and nearly destroyed again in 2018.

4
00:00:32,539 --> 00:00:42,560
To this day, Russian nationalists denounce it, insisting it is Western propaganda, historically inaccurate and unfair to Ivan the Terrible,

5
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:47,399
who even Vladimir Putin argues wasn't so terrible after all.

